				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="503" _ulen="387" >

TFAM^예수금^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
ODER_ABLE_AMT^주문 가능 금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
ODER_ABLE_CASH_AMT^주문 가능 현금 금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
FEE^수수료^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
OPTN_DEAL_PRLS_AMT^옵션 매매 손익 금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
NXDY_DEPS_TTAM^익일 예탁 총액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
VLTN_DEPS_TTAM^평가 예탁 총액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
TDAY_DEAL_PRLS_SMTN^당일 매매 손익 합계^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
RLZT_AMT^실현 금액^20^0^7^0^0^0^0
VLTN_PRLS_SMTN^평가 손익 합계^19^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
